    "detailed_description": "English Title: Reminiscence in the Rain<br>This is a downloadable version of the ADV &quot;Reminiscence in the Rain&quot; (\u30cf\u30eb\u30b8\u30aa\u30f3\u306f\u96e8\u3068\u54b2\u304f) released on December 31st, 2023.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>The world's most &quot;sentimental&quot; tale.<br><br>&quot;Let's go away together.&quot;<br>Those were Yuika Aoi's last words.<br>It was the winter of my first year of college. She disappeared, without a trace.<br>Two years later, I received a phone call.<br><br>&quot;Yuika Aoi has been found.&quot;<br><br>Time began to move again after its long frozen silence.<br>Aoi's past started to be revealed, along with the myth &quot;the town of mermaids.&quot;<br>The true meaning of &quot;memory&quot; swirls in the midst of traditions and incidents.<br>Where had she gone? - only the flower knows.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Information</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Genre: Visual Novel<br></li><li> Play time: 6-8 hours</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Producer Information</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Planning: &quot;Tsuisou&quot; (\u7e0b\u60f3) Project<br></li><li> Scenario/Direction: Gainen Sanagi (\u4f50\u8599\u6982\u5ff5)<br></li><li> System/Music: Ao Takeuma (\u7af9\u99ac\u3042\u304a)<br></li><li> Character Design/Illustration/Backgrounds: Itsuki Inubouzaki (\u72ac\u5420\u57fc\u3044\u3064\u304d)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "English Title: Reminiscence in the Rain<br>This is a downloadable version of the ADV &quot;Reminiscence in the Rain&quot; (\u30cf\u30eb\u30b8\u30aa\u30f3\u306f\u96e8\u3068\u54b2\u304f) released on December 31st, 2023.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>The world's most &quot;sentimental&quot; tale.<br><br>&quot;Let's go away together.&quot;<br>Those were Yuika Aoi's last words.<br>It was the winter of my first year of college. She disappeared, without a trace.<br>Two years later, I received a phone call.<br><br>&quot;Yuika Aoi has been found.&quot;<br><br>Time began to move again after its long frozen silence.<br>Aoi's past started to be revealed, along with the myth &quot;the town of mermaids.&quot;<br>The true meaning of &quot;memory&quot; swirls in the midst of traditions and incidents.<br>Where had she gone? - only the flower knows.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Product Information</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Genre: Visual Novel<br></li><li> Play time: 6-8 hours</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Producer Information</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Planning: &quot;Tsuisou&quot; (\u7e0b\u60f3) Project<br></li><li> Scenario/Direction: Gainen Sanagi (\u4f50\u8599\u6982\u5ff5)<br></li><li> System/Music: Ao Takeuma (\u7af9\u99ac\u3042\u304a)<br></li><li> Character Design/Illustration/Backgrounds: Itsuki Inubouzaki (\u72ac\u5420\u57fc\u3044\u3064\u304d)</li></ul>",
